cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or model, please cite it as below, and cite the datasets listed under references."
title: "Twi OCR: Reading Printed Akan"
abstract: >-
  A Tesseract model and tool chain for printed Asante and Akuapem Twi,
  developed from Tesseract's Latin model on synthetic line images rendered
  from GhanaNLP and Ghana Corpus text, with Twi word-list post-correction.
  Evaluated on scanned pages of Bu Me Bɛ: Proverbs of the Akans. Includes a
  second model and tools for the 19th-century Basel Mission spelling used by
  J. G. Christaller (1879), with a documented, editable orthography table.
authors:
